UPDATE "citation_mining" SET "notes" = '[backward 2026-09-18 21:20] BACKWARD PASS EXECUTED, GAP-025 item 3 DISCHARGED. 25 deposited reference entries, 5 matching the screen -- all pre-1997, NONE carrying a DOI. This is the foundation layer of the 1:12 lineage (a 1957 specifications study, a 1971 Ramp gradients movement study, a 1981 Dutch ramp-accessibility paper) and it is unreachable by any DOI-keyed method. Staged as candidates with their locator problem stated. Full screening record: search_executions exec 74.

DEFERRAL DISCHARGED 2026-09-18 21:20 by session_2026-09-18-research-batch-17-vredenburgh-full-read-and-mining (backward pass). It read: DEPTH-1 DEFERRAL (citation-miner section 6). Discovered by this batch pass over REF-00985; mining it here is hop 2. Expected yield is MODEST AND SHOULD BE SAID SO NOW rather than discovered later: a 1997 paper cites pre-1997 work, and the ramp-slope empirical literature before that date is exactly what REF-01002 abstract calls limited. Rank it below REF-01002 and REF-00979.', "updated_at" = '2026-09-18 21:20', "updated_by_session" = 'session_2026-09-18-research-batch-17-vredenburgh-full-read-and-mining', "deferred_reason" = NULL WHERE "slug" = 'accessible-circulation-geometry' AND "local_ref_id" = '22';
UPDATE "citation_mining" SET "notes" = '[backward 2026-09-18 21:20] BACKWARD PASS EXECUTED, GAP-025 item 2 DISCHARGED. 30 deposited reference entries, 19 matching the ramp/slope/gradient screen against a pre-registered prediction of >= 8 -- the first PROSPECTIVE test of the GAP-018 predictor and it passed. Yield is the propulsion-on-slopes literature nearly entire; six staged as candidates, none admitted in this pass because depth-1 forbids it and because admission needs retrieval and tiering this batch did not have capacity for after the REF-01002 ladder. Full screening record: search_executions exec 73.

DEFERRAL DISCHARGED 2026-09-18 21:20 by session_2026-09-18-research-batch-17-vredenburgh-full-read-and-mining (backward pass). It read: DEPTH-1 DEFERRAL (citation-miner section 6). Discovered by this batch pass over REF-00985; hop 2. Ranks SECOND of the three new deferrals on the predictor GAP-018 sets out for prospective testing: Chow et al. measure propulsion across a slope series, so by that hypothesis they cite the propulsion-on-slopes literature -- the same reasoning that made REF-00985 the productive anchor of this batch. Mining it is therefore also a TEST of GAP-018 hypothesis, and the prediction is recorded here before the pass so the test is real.', "updated_at" = '2026-09-18 21:20', "updated_by_session" = 'session_2026-09-18-research-batch-17-vredenburgh-full-read-and-mining', "deferred_reason" = NULL WHERE "slug" = 'accessible-circulation-geometry' AND "local_ref_id" = '23';

